{"sectionId":"circulation/heart","items":[{"id":"circulation--heart-k001","sectionId":"circulation/heart","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"혈액은 우심방→우심실→폐동맥→폐→폐정맥→좌심방→좌심실→대동맥 순으로 흐른다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--heart-k002","sectionId":"circulation/heart","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"방실판막은 심방-심실 사이, 반월판막은 심실 유출부에 위치한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--heart-k003","sectionId":"circulation/heart","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"동방결절은 정상 박동원이며 방실결절 지연은 심실 충만에 기여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--heart-k004","sectionId":"circulation/heart","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"ECG의 P파는 심방 탈분극, QRS는 심실 탈분극, T파는 심실 재분극을 반영한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--heart-k005","sectionId":"circulation/heart","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"심실 압력-용적 고리는 충만, 등용적 수축, 박출, 등용적 이완 단계로 구분된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--heart-k006","sectionId":"circulation/heart","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"SV=EDV−ESV, CO=HR×SV, EF=SV/EDV이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--heart-k007","sectionId":"circulation/heart","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"전부하는 수축 전 심근 섬유 신장 정도로 EDV 또는 충만압 등으로 근사한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--heart-k008","sectionId":"circulation/heart","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"후부하는 박출 시 이겨야 하는 부하이고 수축력은 주어진 전·후부하에서 심근의 수축 능력이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--heart-k009","sectionId":"circulation/heart","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"Frank-Starling 기전은 생리 범위에서 충만 증가가 박출 증가로 이어지는 현상이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--heart-k010","sectionId":"circulation/heart","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"β1 자극은 심박수·전도·수축력을 증가시키고 미주신경 M2 자극은 심박수와 방실전도를 감소시킨다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--heart-k011","sectionId":"circulation/heart","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"CO=HR×SV; SV=EDV−ESV.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--heart-k012","sectionId":"circulation/heart","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"수축력 증가 시 동일 부하에서 ESV 감소·SV 증가 경향.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--heart-k013","sectionId":"circulation/heart","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"등용적 단계에서는 모든 판막이 닫혀 있다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--heart-k014","sectionId":"circulation/heart","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"S1은 방실판막 폐쇄, S2는 반월판막 폐쇄와 연관된다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--heart-k015","sectionId":"circulation/heart","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"4.9 L/min이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}